  "title": "Powering the AI Revolution: TTM Technologies' Advanced PCBs for Hyperscale Data Centers",
  "summary": "AI adoption is accelerating, and so is the pressure on the hardware that powers it. Data centers rely on high-performance server CPUs and processor platforms to keep pace with growing AI workloads. TTM Technologies (\"TTM\") partners with a UK customer in this space to deliver advanced printed circuit boards (\"PCB\"s) engineered to meet those demands.",
